<view class="page-followup-disease">
  <view class="container">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="section-title">复诊申请</view>
      <view class="fud-row">
        <text class="fud-label">就诊人</text>
        <text class="fud-value">{{patientName || '—'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="fud-row">
        <text class="fud-label">复诊科室</text>
        <text class="fud-value">{{departmentName || '—'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="fud-row">
        <text class="fud-label">复诊医生</text>
        <text class="fud-value">{{doctorName || '—'}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="section-title">选择疾病</view>

      <view wx:if="{{suggestions.length}}" class="fud-sug-row">
        <view
          wx:for="{{suggestions}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          class="fud-sug {{disease === item ? 'fud-sug-on' : ''}}"
          data-name="{{item}}"
          bindtap="onPickSuggestion"
        >{{item}}</view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{suggestions.length}}" class="text-muted fud-sug-tip">
        以上为该医生「擅长」里列出的病种，点一下填进下面，也可以自己写
      </view>

      <textarea
        class="fud-input"
        placeholder="请填写本次复诊的疾病信息"
        placeholder-class="fud-placeholder"
        maxlength="256"
        value="{{disease}}"
        bindinput="onDiseaseInput"
      />
      <view class="text-muted fud-count">{{diseaseLength}}/256</view>
    </view>

    <button
      class="btn-primary fud-submit"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
      bindtap="onSubmit"
    >提交复诊申请</button>

    <view class="text-muted fud-note">
      首版为复诊申请流程演示，不涉及实际开药；用药请遵医嘱。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
